      "message": "Merge origin/side/path-kernel into issue/4269-kernel-plan-converter\n\nKeep both sides of the K4 test helper: the load stage of #4265 goes\nbetween order and link in the plan builder, and the path goes through\nthe real converter. The load pin (k3_load) reads the cuts-only path of\nthe same plan (cuts_path_with, the moves of the old test pen), and its\ndisc Outside row is pinned as measured on the side head: 337 and 77\nafter #4253 and #4265 merged (#4265 measured 334 and 74 without #4253).\n\nRefs #4269\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
