      },
      "message": "Merge origin/side/path-kernel into issue/4269-kernel-plan-converter\n\nThe merge brings PR #4275 (#4254, the approach from the air). Two files\nconflicted:\n- crates/motion/tests/kernel_laws/k3_load.rs: take the Outside rows of\n  #4254. They measure the same on the merged tree with the cuts-only path\n  of this branch. The row 337 / 77 of this branch is replaced.\n- crates/motion/tests/kernel_laws/k4_order_link.rs: keep the real\n  converter and the module text of both sides. The lift counts of #4254\n  (0 on each case) hold.\n\nThe K4 pin also asserts the converter's counts of entries, stay-down\nlinks and exits against the plan. The converted Outside paths now have\nfeed crossings in the air (disc 3, dog bone 1): a link along the air\nline to an approach of #4254 crosses the arc lead of the first entry.\nThe pin asserts them as measured (`CROSSINGS`); follow-up #4300. The\nverifier pin finds no gouge, no rapid in stock and no plunge into stock.\n\nRefs #4269\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
